# This is a documentation-first repo of SQL scripts and prose READMEs.
# Query output — real catalog data — must not be committed. Keeping data out
# avoids publishing patron/collection records and keeps the repo lightweight.

# Report output folders and spreadsheets
excel reports/
*/excel reports/
*.xlsx
*.xls
*.csv

# EXCEPTION: the Horizon schema exports are database *metadata* — object names,
# data types, collations, index and FK definitions. They contain no catalog
# records, no patron data, and no credentials, so the privacy reason for the
# blanket *.csv rule above does not apply to them. They are the source of truth
# behind docs/schema/ and must travel with the repo.
!horizon-schema/*.csv

# Common local/OS cruft
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store

# Local-only denylist of real identifiers for the redaction guard.
# Must never be committed - it exists so the real values stay OUT of the repo.
tools/.redaction-denylist.txt
